      "complete": false,
      "reason": "The fetch URL redirect/latest/macos/{arm64,amd64}/release currently returns the 9.0.2 zips from 2026-09-20. Their versions.txt lists harfbuzz 14.4.0 and x264 0.165.x. git.martin-riedl.de/ffmpeg/build-script has no tags. Branch main (2026-08-17) pins ffmpeg 9.0.1 and harfbuzz 14.3.0, which is not this binary. script/build-x264.sh downloads the floating archive x264-master.tar.gz and there is no version/x264 file."
    },
    {
      "id": "mpv-official-v0.41.0",
      "component": "mpv",
      "version": "v0.41.0",
      "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
      "complete": false,
      "reason": "The v0.41.0 release assets are the binaries only. Job macos for macos-14-arm runs brew update and brew install ffmpeg libplacebo libass without matrix.homebrew, so the bundled libraries are not pinned. ci/build-win32.ps1 clones shaderc with --depth 1 and builds vulkan-loader with UPDATE_DEPS=ON after meson wrap update-db. The mpv tag is the player source, not the corresponding source of those binaries."
    }
